License scope

Original task models: CC BY 4.0
-------------------------------
The original geometry and materials in assets/quarter.usda, assets/penny.usda,
assets/jar.usda and assets/tape.usda are licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Attribute them to the contributors of "Pour and sort mixed coins", identify this
task as the source, include the license link and indicate any modifications.
The models are generated by build_assets.py; their dimensions and simulation
properties are documented in ASSETS.md.

Third-party asset sources and licenses
-------------------------------------
The standard robot assets are supplied through yam-arena 0.1.0 at commit
bd62771e60320433893bd1d2df0fc79b5ddcd6d1:
https://github.com/kairosiann/yam-isaac-lab-arena/tree/bd62771e60320433893bd1d2df0fc79b5ddcd6d1

- YAM robot URDF, meshes and derived collision/USD assets: MIT.
  Source: I2RT Robotics, v1.3.6, commit
  120c3c81400171174604e503943f8d1ebc891058, recorded in
  yam-arena's assets/yam/SOURCE_COMMIT. Copyright I2RT Robotics.
  License:
  https://github.com/i2rt-robotics/i2rt/blob/120c3c81400171174604e503943f8d1ebc891058/LICENSE

- Black/white YAM link meshes: MIT, under the I2RT license above.
  Source: I2RT link meshes distributed with dreamlabs 1.0.23.
  Provenance and file hashes:
  https://github.com/kairosiann/yam-isaac-lab-arena/blob/bd62771e60320433893bd1d2df0fc79b5ddcd6d1/yam_arena/assets/yam/dream/SOURCE

- Arm and camera calibration: MIT.
  Source: ARISE-Initiative/yamlab, commit
  ec0455d2b4ce35f21fc126418ea5e74ac567133d, used through Dream's
  standard station and yam-arena. Copyright (c) 2026 Tianyuan Dai.
  License:
  https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/yamlab/blob/ec0455d2b4ce35f21fc126418ea5e74ac567133d/LICENSE

Procedural workstation geometry
------------------------------
The table, floor and camera stand are boxes and capsules generated at runtime
by yam-arena's task_room, _station_room and _stand_part, using station.py
dimensions and plain procedural materials. No separate workstation mesh,
texture or scanned scene is distributed with this task.
Source:
https://github.com/kairosiann/yam-isaac-lab-arena/blob/bd62771e60320433893bd1d2df0fc79b5ddcd6d1/yam_arena/scene.py

